# sy-file-manager plugin SPEC §4.1 — minisign public-key landing zone.
#
# Manifests with `[plugin.signature] pubkey = "<name>"` resolve to
# `configs/sy/plugin-publishers/<name>.pub`. The pub file is the
# raw minisign public-key string (`untrusted comment: …\n<b64>\n`)
# as emitted by `minisign -G`. First-party plugin pubkeys (the
# canary `sy-plugin-md` etc.) land here; third-party plugins inline
# the pubkey via `[plugin.signature] pubkey = "<base64>"`.
#
# This `.keep` file pins the directory in the tree so `sy apply` has
# a productivisation target on a fresh host (no snowflakes).
